# --- Repo-consolidation staging dir (NEVER ingest — 2026-10-05) --------------
# Misnamed by a buggy PowerShell pipeline (a .NET type name used as a path).
# Holds ~41k files of other repos; must never be reconciled into the depot.
Microsoft.PowerShell.Commands.GenericMeasureInfo/

# --- Dual-home boundary: authored masters are git-authoritative --------------
# (2026-10-05) git owns these protected authors; P4 mirrors BULK content only.
# Prevents P4 from adding new copies of masters that git already protects.
# See .gitignore:221 (!Content/EnvSandbox/Materials/Masters/**).
Content/EnvSandbox/Materials/Masters/
Content/_PROJECT/
